From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:03:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: rockchip-vop2: Add resets

A VOP that a reboot leaves scanning out has to be reset before its IOMMU
translates; let the node name its resets.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
 .../bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop2.yaml           | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop2.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop2.yaml
index 93da1fb..b1770ed 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop2.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop2.yaml
@@ -123,6 +123,13 @@ properties:
   power-domains:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  resets:
+    description:
+      The VOP's own resets, its bus, register and pixel clock domains,
+      pulsed at bind to clear what an earlier stage left scanning out.
+    minItems: 1
+    maxItems: 6
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
